### ============================================================
### AUTENTICAÇÃO — LOGINS PRINCIPAIS
### ============================================================

### Login - TenantAdmin
POST {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/authentication/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "tenantPublicId": "{{tenantPrincipalPublicId}}",
  "email": "login-api@test.local",
  "password": "uma senha longa e segura"
}


### Login - ProjectManager
POST {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/authentication/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "tenantPublicId": "{{tenantPrincipalPublicId}}",
  "email": "project-manager-api@test.local",
  "password": "uma senha longa e segura"
}


### Login - Member
POST {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/authentication/login
Content-Type: application/json
