### Login - SystemAdmin
POST {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/authentication/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "tenantPublicId": null,
  "email": "SEU_EMAIL_DO_SYSTEM_ADMIN",
  "password": "SUA_SENHA_DO_SYSTEM_ADMIN"
}

### Login - Usuário de outro Tenant

POST {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/authentication/login
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "tenantPublicId": "{{tenantSecundarioPublicId}}",
  "email": "usuario-teste-api@test.local",
  "password": "uma senha longa e segura"
}


### ============================================================
### AUTENTICAÇÃO — /ME
### ============================================================

### Authentication - Me - TenantAdmin
GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/authentication/me
Authorization: Bearer {{tenantAdminToken}}
Accept: application/json


### Authentication - Me - ProjectManager
GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/authentication/me
Authorization: Bearer {{projectManagerToken}}
Accept: application/json


### Authentication - Me - Member
GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/authentication/me
Authorization: Bearer {{memberToken}}
Accept: application/json


### Authentication - Me - SystemAdmin
GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/authentication/me
Authorization: Bearer {{systemAdminToken}}
Accept: application/json


### Authentication - Me - Sem token - deve retornar 401 Unauthorized
GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/authentication/me
Accept: application/json


### Authentication - Me - Token inválido - deve retornar 401 Unauthorized
GET {{WorkFlow_API_HostAddress}}/api/authentication/me
Authorization: Bearer token-invalido
Accept: application/json


